@startuml CU-13
actor "Cliente" as Cli
boundary "«UI» Angular (carrito/reservas)" as UI
control "«Controller» API /cart, /reservations" as Ctrl
entity "«Model» CartService / ReservationService / Inventory" as Model

Cli -> UI : 1: agregar variante
UI -> Ctrl : 2: POST /cart/items
Ctrl -> Model : 3: add_item(db, cart, variant, qty)
Model --> Ctrl : 4: carrito + total
Ctrl --> UI : 5: CartRead
UI --> Cli : 6: carrito actualizado

Cli -> UI : 7: confirmar check-out
UI -> Ctrl : 8: POST /cart/checkout
Ctrl -> Model : 9: create(db, client, items)
Model --> Ctrl : 10: reserva PENDING + pickup_code
Ctrl -> Model : 11: clear(cart)
Ctrl --> UI : 12: ReservationRead
UI --> Cli : 13: código de recogida

Cli -> UI : 14: cancelar reserva
UI -> Ctrl : 15: PATCH /reservations/{id}/status
Ctrl -> Model : 16: transition(CANCELLED) → libera stock reservado
Model --> Ctrl : 17: reserva CANCELLED
Ctrl --> UI : 18: ReservationRead

@enduml